WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
My daily life wasn't that great, mostly because I was very dependent

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.678
My screen time was pretty high, up to 10

00:00:06.678 --> 00:00:08.000
hours in the weekends

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.480
And that's why I just used my time very unproductive

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.818
The biggest difference between now and before is that

00:00:13.818 --> 00:00:16.400
I have planned and made plans for my life

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.746
I have created structure, I have had a motivation

00:00:18.746 --> 00:00:21.331
for training, because that was something that I talked

00:00:21.331 --> 00:00:22.480
about as the first thing

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.466
We continued to talk together, because it also meant

00:00:24.466 --> 00:00:25.917
that there was a person I was going to

00:00:25.917 --> 00:00:26.719
end up accounting for
